@startuml
!pragma useIntermediatePackages false
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide methods
hide empty members
left to right direction

class Event {
  +specversion: string [1] = "1.0"
  +id: string [1]
  +source: string [1]
  +subject: string [1]
  +type: string [1]
  +time: DateTimeUtc [1]
  +datacontenttype: string [0..1] = "application/json"
  +dataschema: string [1]
  +data: EventData [1]
}

note bottom of Event
  **type** = io.admin-shell.<object>.<modification>.v1
  <modification> = created | updated | deleted
  **source** = URI identifying the service
  **subject** = identification of the modified object
  **dataschema** = https://admin-shell.io/aas/API/Events/<data class>/3/3
  **time** = point in time at which the modification was persisted
  **data**: for deleted events the state before the modification
end note

abstract class EventData <<abstract>>

class AssetAdministrationShellEventData {
  +globalAssetIds: Identifier [0..*]
  +assetAdministrationShell: AssetAdministrationShell [1]
}
note right of AssetAdministrationShellEventData
  **type**: io.admin-shell.aas.<modification>.v1
  **subject**: id of the AAS
  **dataschema**: .../Events/AssetAdministrationShellEventData/3/3
  **globalAssetIds**: globalAssetId of the AAS
  (at most one entry)
  **assetAdministrationShell**: complete AAS
  as returned by GetAssetAdministrationShellById
end note

class SubmodelEventData {
  +globalAssetIds: Identifier [0..*]
  +submodel: Submodel [1]
}
note right of SubmodelEventData
  **type**: io.admin-shell.submodel.<modification>.v1
  **subject**: id of the Submodel
  **dataschema**: .../Events/SubmodelEventData/3/3
  **globalAssetIds**: globalAssetIds of all AAS
  of the service that reference the Submodel
  **submodel**: Content Metadata, i.e. all
  attributes except submodelElements
end note

class ConceptDescriptionEventData {
  +conceptDescription: ConceptDescription [1]
}
note right of ConceptDescriptionEventData
  **type**: io.admin-shell.conceptdescription.<modification>.v1
  **subject**: id of the CD
  **dataschema**: .../Events/ConceptDescriptionEventData/3/3
  **conceptDescription**: complete CD
  as returned by GetConceptDescriptionById
end note

class AssetEventData {
  +globalAssetIds: Identifier [1..*]
  +assetAdministrationShells: Reference [0..*]
}
note right of AssetEventData
  **type**: io.admin-shell.asset.<modification>.v1
  **subject**: globalAssetId of the asset
  **dataschema**: .../Events/AssetEventData/3/3
  **globalAssetIds**: globalAssetId of the asset
  (exactly one entry)
  **assetAdministrationShells**: ModelReferences
  to the AAS linked to the asset
end note

Event *-- "1" EventData : data
EventData <|-- AssetAdministrationShellEventData
EventData <|-- SubmodelEventData
EventData <|-- ConceptDescriptionEventData
EventData <|-- AssetEventData

@enduml
